             </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n  <div class=\"product-blocks-details product-blocks-448 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-448-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-448-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-448-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-460 blocks-grid\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n              <div class=\"module-item module-item-1\">\n            <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n          <h3 class=\"title module-title block-title\">Key Features</h3>\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-features-description\">\n      <ul>\n                  <li>Model : PK65H</li>\n                  <li>Transmission Distance: ≥ 1km</li>\n                  <li>Design of intelligent circuit &amp; line scanning</li>\n                  <li>With Visible Laser Beam, to have fault checking of optical fibre</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2>i -POOK PK65H Multi-Purpose Wire Tracker Cable Tester with Underground Cable Locator</h2><p><br></p><p>The i-POOK PK65H is a professional-grade multi-purpose wire tracker and cable tester designed for accurate tracing, testing, and locating of cables — including underground and hidden wires. Ideal for network installers, electricians, and DIY enthusiasts, this device offers an efficient solution for identifying cable paths and diagnosing connectivity issues.</p><p><br></p><p>Equipped with advanced detection technology, the PK65H can trace Ethernet, telephone, coaxial, and electrical cables, even when buried underground or behind walls. The receiver and transmitter system ensures precise signal tracking, while built-in tone generator and continuity test functions make it easy to find cable breaks, shorts, and miswires.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're maintaining network lines, testing telephone cables, or locating electrical wiring, the i-POOK PK65H simplifies your task with clear LED indicators, adjustable signal strength, and a user-friendly interface.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Tests RJ45 (LAN) and RJ11 (telephone) cables</li><li>Supports UTP and STP cable testing</li><li>Accurately identifies and traces wires among multiple lines</li><li>Works in unpowered electrical systems</li><li>Detects short circuits, open circuits, miswires, and cross connections</li><li>Auto-scan mode for full LAN cable connectivity check (1-8)</li><li>Traces PoE-connected Ethernet cables</li><li>Visible laser beam for optical fiber fault checking</li><li>Audio and visual signal indicators</li><li>Earphone output for noisy environments</li><li>Adjustable volume and LED flashlight for dark areas</li><li>Auto power-off for extended battery life</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n          